# phase-complete-review skill

Before **`gh pr create`**, opening a milestone PR, or when the user says **"ready to push"**, **"review my PR"**, **"is this ready"**, or **"check before I push"**:

1. **Read and apply** `.cursor/skills/phase-complete-review/SKILL.md`.
2. Run Pass 1 (section-reading audit) and Pass 2 (per-area checklists).
3. Fix violations or list them explicitly before opening the PR.

Load once per milestone at PR time — not on every ticket. Parity: `.claude/skills/phase-complete-review/SKILL.md`.
